# HP39gs Stock Font Gallery through the original APLET UI and serial disk.
# The first ENTER starts the lazy HPGCC/APLET transfer; host-gate resumes the
# launch only after Kermit has successfully completed LIB275L.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
7000 tap aplet
8000 capture aplet-library
9000 tap f5
10000 capture receive-menu
10500 tap down
11200 tap down
11900 tap down
12600 tap down
12900 capture receive-serial-disk
13300 tap enter
31000 capture remote-aplet
32500 tap enter
34000 capture lazy-fetch
35000 host-gate

# Times below are relative to host-gate release. Gallery needs the historical
# two ENTERs: one reaches the downloaded aplet launch screen, the second enters
# HPC1. Captures retain both sample/text states for the ROM-pixel oracle.
0 monitor 90000
500 capture fetch-complete
1000 tap enter
7000 tap enter
19000 capture native-mini
22000 tap enter
25000 capture native-mini-other
28000 tap down
31000 capture native-main
34000 tap enter
37000 capture native-main-other
40000 tap down
43000 capture native-editline
46000 tap enter
49000 capture native-editline-other
52000 tap right
55000 capture generated-control
58000 tap on
